      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-13T22:26:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I read the latest Kickstarter update, which mentioned the Downloads link on the new home page, and went to the new home page to check it out.&nbsp; But I couldn't find it.&nbsp; I figured it'd be up top with the other important links, but it's not there.&nbsp; I scanned the boxes at the bottom of the page, but all I could find were boxes for News, Twitter, Facebook, and Mailing List...</p><p>Oh wait, there it is, inexplicably shoehorned into the Mailing List box.&nbsp; I'm sure some will say that that's not a Mailing List box but rather a multi-purpose box full of various stuff, but since all the other boxes are all single-purpose, having the last box be a trash bin for links that didn't fit other places is hazardous from a usability perspective.&nbsp; I suggest either the box be redesigned so it's obvious that various unrelated links can be found within it (weak) or that the box be given a single purpose like the others and unrelated links be moved elsewhere (strong).</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
